  "id": "coconut-cashew-butternut-squash-curry",
  "name": "Coconut Cashew Butternut Squash Curry",
  "subtitle": "A creamy vegan curry with squash, chickpeas, raisins, and cashews.",
  "description": "A gently spiced coconut curry combining tender butternut squash, chickpeas, tomatoes, and ground cashews for a rich, satisfying main dish.",
